                        "review": "Enjoyable puzzle game. \n\nHowever the interface is a bit confusing.  It's not obvious how to load your saved (done manually) game.   There is no load game option in the options menu. It is only available from the title screen.  \nWould be nice if the game auto-loaded your last save file too.\n\nThanks to the dev for responding to this.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nPrevious review:\n\nWas really enjoying this game, and then I had a break from it.  All my progress was lost.  The save functionality does not work. Therefore I cannot reccommend this in it's current state",
